Sanguis Noxa (commonly known as Vampirism) is the family of blood diseases associated with nightkin. While vampirism is commonly passed down from "sire" to "thrall," new strains can be manufactured by exposing a healthy mortal to noxblood.

Noxblood is taken from the body of [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]], which lies in the mines beneath [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Umbervale Hold|Umbervale Hold]] in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. The [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] has lately spread a weak noxblood through the food of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Sarengrad|Sarengrad]], in amounts too small to turn anyone at once, but enough to gather in a body over time.

[[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]] holds the [[Phenomena/Althane/Wasting Fever|wasting fever]] of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] to be a mild or unfinished form of the sickness, its sufferers lesser nightkin.
